      "rationale": "Re-runs the summary read only when repo, master, leaf or the passed facts change, never on the analytics document itself. Each read takes a sequence number, and only the newest still-mounted read may store its answer, which is filed under its repo/master/leaf key; a late answer for a previous leaf is dropped or shown as loading.",
